  </title>
  <description type="4">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;This activity links the dots and creates valuable connections between companies and youth, as this &apos;pre-employment&apos; program breeds talent and connects businesses with them. This is not just any skills development training for Ghanaian youth. The aim is to match companies and youth within a niche: the food and agric sector. &quot;</narrative>
