  <document-link format="APPLICATION/VND.OPENXMLFORMATS-OFFICEDOCUMENT.WORDPROCESSINGML.DOCUMENT" url="https://iatipublisher-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/document-link/92/Narrative%20Report%20YFP%20July-December%202024%201745580069.docx">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">YOUTH IN FOOD (JULY - DEC 2024)</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">How many youths have participated in the program? 
&#x25CF;	381 applications were received for cohort IV.
&#x25CF;	50 youth were selected for the YFP cohort IV program
&#x25CF;	YFP Alumni network increased to 145 youth 

Soft skills training (In-Person and online skills Training)?
&#x25CF;	85% of participants rated skills sessions as highly valuable (4 or 5).
&#x25CF;	72.5% of participants found the mentorship program excellent.
&#x25CF;	Significant improvement in job search and CV-writing skills, with 64.1% rating the CV-writing session as valuable.
&#x25CF;	Over 15 soft skills training sessions organized 
&#x25CF;	All 50 youths attended the skills training sessions

How many (in percentage) have been connected with companies through our program?
&#x25CF;	 Over 40 youth are currently employed 
&#x25CF;	Representing 80% implementation rate 

Impact- How many youths have received a job offer through the program?
&#x25CF;	Over 60 vacancies directly made available through the YFP team
&#x25CF;	Over 30 vacancies and interviews facilitated through the mentorship</narrative>
   </description>
